                [ 'p', 'xTool machines help, but they don’t replace vigilance. The S1 detects flames from five directions, the F1 Ultra and F2 Ultra stop work in case of fire, and the X1 has fire safety for long runs. In the EU, xTool also offers automatic fire extinguishing linked to the machine: the Fire Safety Set for the S1, F1 Ultra, F2 Ultra and F2 Ultra UV, among others, and the Fire Safety Set 2 for the X1.' ],
                [ 'h2', 'A laser at home: where to put it and how to power it' ],
