                    'An earthed socket without daisy-chained extension leads. If the laser, extraction and cooling run together, check the load on the circuit.',
                    'Free space for airflow and a room temperature within the manual’s range – in a cold garage, take particular care with liquid-cooled CO₂ lasers.',
                ] ],
                [ 'h2', 'Lasers in schools and around children' ],
                [ 'p', 'A sensible baseline is an enclosed Class 1 machine that an adult controls. A few simple rules help:' ],
